{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24385","headline":"幽居早秋闲咏 · 白居易","name":"幽居早秋闲咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽僻嚣尘外，清凉水木间。\n卧风秋拂簟，步月夜开关。\n且得身安泰，从他世险艰。\n但休争要路，不必入深山。\n轩鹤留何用，泉鱼放不还。\n谁人知此味，临老十年闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}